  "id": "perceptual-distortion",
  "term": "perceptual distortion",
  "definition": "Perceptual distortion is a mismatch between how a stimulus is usually perceived and how a particular person perceives it in the same situation. In plain language, it means perceiving something differently from the common or expected way under given conditions.",
